## Local configuration template
## Copy this file to local.properties and add your actual API keys.
## local.properties is ignored by git and will never be committed.

## Android SDK Location
sdk.dir=/Users/username/Library/Android/sdk

## Pexels API Key (Get a free key from https://www.pexels.com/api/)
PEXELS_API_KEY=your_pexels_api_key_here

## Unsplash Access Key (Optional)
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=your_unsplash_access_key_here
